<title>MEXICO: U.S.-Mexico livestock movements update - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S.-Mexico livestock movements update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movements between Mexico and the United States, to Oct 4 - USDA (Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>Mexican exports</p>
<p>    Type			   Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Feeders		     1,925	  220,880  1,202,180</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		816     69,829</p>
